00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.945
Well, guys, the big story today

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.381
is that following this week's
Supreme Court ruling,

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:16.783
Trump was forced to turn over

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.385 line:0%
millions of pages
