District Attorney's Office.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:23.422
Millions of pages, yeah.

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:25.491
The only place
you'll find more ink

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:28.761
is Rudy Giuliani's sideburns.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:30.729
I feel bad for whoever's
second in line

00:00:30.729 --> 00:00:32.465
to use the copier
in that office.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.401
Like, "Uh, how long
you going to be?"

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:38.771
Like, "Oh, shouldn't be --
There's only like 100,000 more.

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:43.076
Double sided, so maybe go get
a frappuccino and come back."

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:46.779
But this really is big news
because after they thoroughly

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:48.481
go through each document,

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:53.152
Trump could be charged
around the year 3000.

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:56.189
You can tell that they're
Trump's real tax returns because

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:59.893
under total loss, he still
didn't declare the election.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.761
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:03.095
[ Applause ]

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:06.132
We're having a good time.

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:09.169
Speaking of Trump, President
Biden's been in an office

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:10.904
