a visual component, sure.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.509
-It's all so predictable.

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:53.879
Like, the graphic will be
a photo of Biden and Trump,

00:01:53.879 --> 00:01:56.215 line:0%
