you'll list names like

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:57.984 line:0%
LL Coup J...

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.719 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.221 line:0%
...or One Term-inator...

00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:03.389 line:0%
-Uh-huh.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:07.327 line:0%
-...or, uh, Don Jr. Sr.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:11.464 line:0%
Or, uh, Princess Impeached.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:15.635 line:0%
